I was asleep when she left me.

822
01:15:11,135 --> 01:15:12,136
But...

823
01:15:14,827 --> 01:15:17,037
But I felt it...

824
01:15:17,910 --> 01:15:21,205
I felt her hug before she left.

825
01:15:28,569 --> 01:15:31,510
I've found your mom, Brenda.

826
01:15:33,741 --> 01:15:35,952
Are you ready to see her?

827
01:15:46,039 --> 01:15:49,288
We locked her up because her mind wasn't sound anymore.

828
01:15:49,457 --> 01:15:50,988
She almost killed me.

829
01:15:52,023 --> 01:15:53,916
Didn't you have her treated?

830
01:15:53,941 --> 01:15:56,282
We tried but she didn't get better.

831
01:15:56,342 --> 01:16:00,263
I think your father's mistress cursed her, Brenda.

832
01:16:00,801 --> 01:16:05,481
My God, this is as far as we can care for her.

833
01:16:06,340 --> 01:16:11,220
We're poor. I also struggle with daily medicine expenses.

834
01:16:11,657 --> 01:16:13,659
Come, she's here.

835
01:17:02,704 --> 01:17:04,051
What's this?

836
01:17:06,166 --> 01:17:07,459
Mom?

837
01:17:07,794 --> 01:17:09,796
Mom.

838
01:17:11,468 --> 01:17:12,678
Mom?

839
01:17:13,262 --> 01:17:16,890
Mom, it's me, I'm Brenda, your daughter.

840
01:17:17,991 --> 01:17:22,954
Sorry, I wasn't able to clean her. She has diarrhea, so it's messy.

841
01:17:25,256 --> 01:17:28,243
Mom, how are you?

842
01:17:28,475 --> 01:17:29,973
Mom.

843
01:17:30,805 --> 01:17:33,391
Mom, how are you?

844
01:17:36,044 --> 01:17:37,252
Mom, it's me.

845
01:17:37,277 --> 01:17:38,861
Who are you?

846
01:17:39,032 --> 01:17:41,078
- It's me, Brenda. - I'm busy!

847
01:17:42,193 --> 01:17:44,931
- Why are you in my office? - Mom!

848
01:17:45,041 --> 01:17:46,103
Melonia?

849
01:17:46,157 --> 01:17:48,585
- Mom! - Has my child arrived?

850
01:17:49,538 --> 01:17:52,958
When she arrives, tell her we have something important to discuss, okay?

851
01:17:53,694 --> 01:17:54,694
Mom!

852
01:17:56,551 --> 01:17:57,551
I'm busy!

853
01:17:58,662 --> 01:18:00,364
- Mom, it's me. - Why are you in my office?

854
01:18:00,389 --> 01:18:02,445
No matter how many times you try,

855
01:18:02,470 --> 01:18:03,825
she won't recognize you.

856
01:18:07,454 --> 01:18:12,332
Get out of here! Why are you in my office? Who are you?

857
01:18:12,519 --> 01:18:15,853
Mom! Mom!

858
01:18:17,144 --> 01:18:18,144
Mom!

859
01:18:18,693 --> 01:18:22,838
Leave now! I don't want anyone here!

860
01:18:25,838 --> 01:18:26,838
Mom!

861
01:18:27,452 --> 01:18:29,253
Mom!

862
01:18:29,278 --> 01:18:30,453
Leave!

863
01:18:34,597 --> 01:18:39,207
Melonia! I'll sign the papers now!

864
01:18:40,472 --> 01:18:42,328
Has my child arrived?

865
01:18:45,231 --> 01:18:48,911
You're so noisy, get out of here! Who are you?

866
01:18:52,022 --> 01:18:53,050
Melonia!

867
01:19:20,064 --> 01:19:21,677
So, you saw your mom?

868
01:19:25,138 --> 01:19:26,301
Good thing she's still alive.

869
01:19:28,928 --> 01:19:30,888
Do you want to see your father?

870
01:19:32,175 --> 01:19:33,348
I saw him recently.

871
01:19:34,810 --> 01:19:36,818
Where did you see my bastard father?

872
01:19:39,027 --> 01:19:40,635
Over by the Sta. Ana bridge.

873
01:19:41,484 --> 01:19:43,210
With a gay partner.

874
01:19:43,891 --> 01:19:45,962
I don't know if they're still there now.

875
01:19:49,334 --> 01:19:50,364
Go see him.

876
01:19:52,538 --> 01:19:54,771
[child crying]

877
01:20:16,175 --> 01:20:18,991
Sir, stop over there by the post.

878
01:20:19,773 --> 01:20:20,773
There.

879
01:20:23,677 --> 01:20:25,320
Straight ahead, a little further.

880
01:20:27,576 --> 01:20:28,719
There, just stop there.

881
01:20:30,654 --> 01:20:31,723
I'll get down here, sir.

882
01:20:33,176 --> 01:20:34,176
Okay...

883
01:20:37,127 --> 01:20:38,337
Thank you.

884
01:21:15,819 --> 01:21:18,500
Uh, sir, do you know someone named Dado here?

885
01:21:18,569 --> 01:21:19,670
- Dado? - Yes.

886
01:21:19,695 --> 01:21:21,015
Yes, At the end, near the bridge.

887
01:21:21,075 --> 01:21:22,080
- At the end? - Yes.

888
01:21:22,105 --> 01:21:23,105
Thanks.

889
01:21:46,858 --> 01:21:51,150
Oh, just when you're hanging laundry, it rains.

890
01:21:51,441 --> 01:21:53,346
- Excuse me. - Oh, life,

891
01:21:53,371 --> 01:21:55,121
you'll just end up singing.

892
01:21:58,009 --> 01:22:01,279
Hello, do you know Dado? Is he here?

893
01:22:02,185 --> 01:22:04,186
Why are you looking for my husband?

894
01:22:04,279 --> 01:22:06,765
Call him so you'll know who I am.

895
01:22:08,461 --> 01:22:10,200
If you're my husband's mistress,

896
01:22:12,206 --> 01:22:13,784
I'm prettier than you.

897
01:22:14,143 --> 01:22:16,938
If you're pretty, then there are no ugly people in the world.

898
01:22:17,710 --> 01:22:18,920
She's too much.

899
01:22:19,194 --> 01:22:20,654
Who are you talking to, Beauty?

900
01:22:21,329 --> 01:22:23,331
Someone's looking for you. You took too long.

901
01:22:25,413 --> 01:22:26,827
How are you, Dado?

902
01:22:27,556 --> 01:22:28,599
Brenda!

903
01:22:29,691 --> 01:22:30,691
Do you know her?

904
01:22:30,816 --> 01:22:31,817
Yes, dear.

905
01:22:31,975 --> 01:22:33,059
She's my daughter.

906
01:22:35,240 --> 01:22:36,773
Whose child are you again?

907
01:22:37,845 --> 01:22:40,423
Oh right, from that crazy Anita.

908
01:22:41,220 --> 01:22:42,220
Well,

909
01:22:42,363 --> 01:22:45,158
if you came here for support...

910
01:22:45,461 --> 01:22:47,459
Girl, you're grown up now.

911
01:22:48,188 --> 01:22:50,944
You should know how to manage life by now.

912
01:22:51,608 --> 01:22:53,264
You look good now, Brenda.

913
01:22:54,702 --> 01:22:56,329
You can strut again.

914
01:22:58,035 --> 01:23:01,998
I'm sure many will still be interested in your body.

915
01:23:02,733 --> 01:23:06,929
Better yet, come back with me.

916
01:23:07,421 --> 01:23:09,631
I'll take care of you, love you.

917
01:23:09,656 --> 01:23:11,840
Damn you! Bastard!

918
01:23:11,865 --> 01:23:12,923
Bitch!

919
01:23:13,358 --> 01:23:15,398
You think you're tough, huh? Remember, I'm your dad!

920
01:23:15,864 --> 01:23:17,697
You are my father but you made me your wife.

921
01:23:17,722 --> 01:23:18,854
Then what?

922
01:23:18,996 --> 01:23:20,788
You sold me, you animal!

923
01:23:20,853 --> 01:23:22,517
Huh?

924
01:23:22,731 --> 01:23:25,104
- Talk to this rude woman. - What's happening?

925
01:23:25,261 --> 01:23:26,526
Damn you!

926
01:23:27,623 --> 01:23:30,208
- Damn you, you violated me! - Dado!

927
01:23:30,233 --> 01:23:33,735
You violated me, my mom went insane because of you!

928
01:23:33,760 --> 01:23:34,844
Stop it!

929
01:23:34,869 --> 01:23:37,015
- Want me to hit you next? - No! Stop it!

930
01:23:37,040 --> 01:23:38,706
- Damn you! - Dado!

931
01:23:41,219 --> 01:23:43,067
Neighbors!

932
01:23:43,246 --> 01:23:44,969
Dado!

933
01:23:45,300 --> 01:23:46,454
Dado!

934
01:23:48,087 --> 01:23:50,674
Help us, please!

935
01:23:53,857 --> 01:23:55,931
Mama Miriam? Sister Carol?

936
01:23:58,671 --> 01:24:00,603
Mama Miriam? Sister Carol?

937
01:24:03,050 --> 01:24:05,253
Mama Miriam? Sister Carol?

938
01:24:06,809 --> 01:24:08,506
That must be Brenda.

939
01:24:09,410 --> 01:24:11,412
Brenda?

940
01:24:13,802 --> 01:24:17,830
- Where have you been? - We were so worried about you.

941
01:24:21,015 --> 01:24:25,434
Mama Miriam, I've avenged my mom.

942
01:24:27,386 --> 01:24:29,432
And myself, against my father.

943
01:24:29,970 --> 01:24:32,611
What did you do, did you kill your father?

944
01:24:33,237 --> 01:24:35,086
Mama Miriam, killed right away?

945
01:24:36,570 --> 01:24:40,803
I hit him with a plank until he fell into the river.

946
01:24:42,654 --> 01:24:44,933
It feels so good, Mama Miriam.

947
01:24:45,351 --> 01:24:49,547
It feels so good… It feels so good.

948
01:24:51,187 --> 01:24:53,806
Come on, let's go inside now, okay?

949
01:25:14,527 --> 01:25:15,543
How are you?

950
01:25:18,607 --> 01:25:19,692
Here…

951
01:25:22,337 --> 01:25:23,478
Still alive.

952
01:25:28,621 --> 01:25:31,073
We all go through painful things, right?

953
01:25:32,885 --> 01:25:34,234
But we endure them.

954
01:25:41,127 --> 01:25:42,462
I'm okay, Hesus.

955
01:25:46,010 --> 01:25:47,063
I'm okay.

956
01:25:50,772 --> 01:25:53,709
When I saw my mom,

957
01:25:58,871 --> 01:26:00,387
I was hurt…

958
01:26:02,818 --> 01:26:04,450
hurt by her condition.

959
01:26:10,460 --> 01:26:18,225
But when I saw my father, I beat him up.

960
01:26:25,183 --> 01:26:27,185
I felt so light.

961
01:26:32,732 --> 01:26:33,734
There's...

962
01:26:34,790 --> 01:26:35,903
There's some sadness.

963
01:26:39,729 --> 01:26:40,898
But...

964
01:26:44,995 --> 01:26:49,584
I feel quite happy now.

965
01:26:52,685 --> 01:26:54,447
I'm happy for you, Brenda.

966
01:26:56,702 --> 01:26:58,076
But no matter what happens,

967
01:26:59,843 --> 01:27:01,220
I'll always be here for you.

968
01:27:07,600 --> 01:27:08,644
Thank you.

969
01:27:09,965 --> 01:27:10,997
Thank you.

970
01:27:28,269 --> 01:27:29,290
Lucio, are you okay?

971
01:27:30,311 --> 01:27:32,016
Brenda, Brenda,

972
01:27:32,041 --> 01:27:33,727
so many things are troubling my mind.

973
01:27:34,872 --> 01:27:36,289
I'm confused now.

974
01:27:36,504 --> 01:27:38,673
Do you want me to call Mama Miriam,

975
01:27:39,007 --> 01:27:40,176
- so they can give you medicine? - No, no.

976
01:27:40,200 --> 01:27:41,434
Don't ever do that.

977
01:27:42,510 --> 01:27:44,596
Brenda, I need a different kind of medicine.

978
01:27:44,804 --> 01:27:47,626
- Stop it, Lucio! - I need another kind of medicine.

979
01:27:47,903 --> 01:27:49,702
Stay away from drugs!

980
01:27:50,563 --> 01:27:52,439
Damn it, you don't understand me.

981
01:27:53,104 --> 01:27:54,768
That's the medicine I need.

982
01:27:54,874 --> 01:27:57,834
I'm not happy here anymore, I'm only getting worse, Brenda.

983
01:27:57,859 --> 01:27:59,145
I don't want to stay here.

984
01:27:59,170 --> 01:28:00,621
We're fine here, right?

985
01:28:00,672 --> 01:28:02,738
We eat three meals a day, even snacks,

986
01:28:02,762 --> 01:28:04,532
we have a bed, and people who take care of us.

987
01:28:04,556 --> 01:28:05,575
What do you want?

988
01:28:05,600 --> 01:28:08,040
- Is something missing? - Damn it! I'm not happy here anymore!

989
01:28:08,552 --> 01:28:11,711
I don't want this anymore, I want to leave. Please.

990
01:28:11,743 --> 01:28:13,410
I don't want this.

991
01:28:13,932 --> 01:28:15,708
I want to leave here, listen to me.

992
01:28:16,628 --> 01:28:17,797
Where will you go?

993
01:28:21,441 --> 01:28:23,109
Where I used to live.

994
01:28:23,343 --> 01:28:25,953
At the cemetery. I'll be there.

995
01:28:26,281 --> 01:28:27,640
You'll find me there.

996
01:28:29,700 --> 01:28:30,701
I don't want to stay here.

997
01:28:30,725 --> 01:28:31,726
Lucio!

998
01:28:32,012 --> 01:28:33,685
- Lucio! - I can't take it anymore.

999
01:28:48,599 --> 01:28:50,119
Sorry, I didn't notice you were there.

1000
01:28:51,514 --> 01:28:53,118
I was watching you.

1001
01:28:54,233 --> 01:28:57,528
You dance so well, huh? Do you want to dance? Mm?

1002
01:28:58,370 --> 01:29:00,370
Pau, I have something for you.

1003
01:29:00,755 --> 01:29:01,755
Oh my.

1004
01:29:02,191 --> 01:29:03,258
What's that?

1005
01:29:03,403 --> 01:29:04,904
You're so thoughtful.

1006
01:29:05,844 --> 01:29:08,596
You know, in my whole life,

1007
01:29:09,848 --> 01:29:12,433
this is the first time someone gave me flowers.

1008
01:29:14,176 --> 01:29:16,178
Do you like it? Huh?

1009
01:29:16,629 --> 01:29:19,373
Oh, Lucio… don't be like that.

1010
01:29:19,398 --> 01:29:21,100
- Why? - I fall in love easily.

1011
01:29:21,290 --> 01:29:22,875
Really? Well...

1012
01:29:23,452 --> 01:29:24,572
I just...

1013
01:29:25,097 --> 01:29:27,391
I just want to ask you a favor.

1014
01:29:28,449 --> 01:29:30,201
What is it?

1015
01:29:31,034 --> 01:29:33,197
I just need a cellphone.

1016
01:29:33,788 --> 01:29:36,498
I need to go somewhere and make a call.

1017
01:29:36,542 --> 01:29:38,041
Maybe I can borrow one.

1018
01:29:38,615 --> 01:29:40,407
- Please… - Where...

1019
01:29:40,548 --> 01:29:42,028
Where are you going?

1020
01:29:42,052 --> 01:29:43,676
Do Mama Miriam and the others know?

1021
01:29:44,923 --> 01:29:46,419
Don't tell them, okay?

1022
01:29:46,634 --> 01:29:47,776
Don't tell them.

1023
01:29:49,050 --> 01:29:51,803
I need to find my relatives, I miss them.

1024
01:29:52,060 --> 01:29:53,060
Anyway,

1025
01:29:53,924 --> 01:29:55,687
when I find them,

1026
01:29:56,287 --> 01:29:58,692
I'll tell them you're the one I love.

1027
01:30:01,627 --> 01:30:02,879
Do you love me?

1028
01:30:03,985 --> 01:30:05,015
Don't you believe me?

1029
01:30:05,278 --> 01:30:06,404
Because...

1030
01:30:06,797 --> 01:30:10,091
In my whole life, this is the first time someone told me they love me.

1031
01:30:10,116 --> 01:30:12,193
From a man.

1032
01:30:16,372 --> 01:30:17,415
Pau.

1033
01:30:18,162 --> 01:30:19,497
I love you!

1034
01:30:20,056 --> 01:30:21,673
I love you, okay?

1035
01:30:24,047 --> 01:30:25,215
Hmm?

1036
01:30:28,468 --> 01:30:29,469
Come on.

1037
01:30:29,945 --> 01:30:31,654
I just need a cellphone, I'm in a hurry.

1038
01:30:31,679 --> 01:30:33,932
Maybe you have extra. I need money.

1039
01:30:33,957 --> 01:30:37,251
Here. From my mom in Canada.

1040
01:30:38,467 --> 01:30:40,135
If you trust me.

1041
01:30:41,066 --> 01:30:42,486
The cellphone?

1042
01:30:42,583 --> 01:30:43,750
Come on.

1043
01:30:43,775 --> 01:30:44,943
Cellphone.

1044
01:30:46,194 --> 01:30:47,571
- Come on. - Here.

1045
01:30:51,574 --> 01:30:55,327
Here it is, just make sure to return my phone, okay?

1046
01:30:55,352 --> 01:30:57,521
I'll come back. I'll return it, okay?

1047
01:30:57,956 --> 01:30:58,998
Okay.

1048
01:30:58,999 --> 01:31:00,832
Just don't tell Mama Miriam, alright?

1049
01:31:00,833 --> 01:31:03,054
- I promise. - Thank you.

1050
01:31:03,079 --> 01:31:07,355
Just promise you'll introduce me to your family, okay? I'd love that.

1051
01:31:10,118 --> 01:31:11,345
I gotta go.

1052
01:31:16,659 --> 01:31:19,827
Mama Miriam, Mama Miriam! Sister Carol!

1053
01:31:19,852 --> 01:31:22,897
Paulo, what is it? It's so early.

1054
01:31:23,771 --> 01:31:25,773
Lucio's gone.

1055
01:31:25,998 --> 01:31:27,856
Lucio…

1056
01:31:28,837 --> 01:31:29,905
What?

1057
01:31:30,021 --> 01:31:32,023
He left us.

1058
01:31:32,297 --> 01:31:33,882
Wait, wait.

1059
01:31:35,279 --> 01:31:37,281
What happened, Paulo?

1060
01:31:39,860 --> 01:31:44,707
He took my cellphone, my things.

1061
01:31:44,985 --> 01:31:48,024
That bastard! That bastard…

1062
01:31:48,532 --> 01:31:50,900
He tricked me, he's a thief.

1063
01:31:51,747 --> 01:31:55,444
He even told Hesus he won't come back.

1064
01:31:57,470 --> 01:31:58,509
But...

1065
01:31:59,879 --> 01:32:01,381
But it's okay.

1066
01:32:02,399 --> 01:32:05,152
He can take everything from me, as long as he doesn't leave me.

1067
01:32:05,690 --> 01:32:07,571
I love him so much.

1068
01:32:07,596 --> 01:32:10,044
Mama Miriam, I love him.

1069
01:32:11,321 --> 01:32:13,322
I really love him.

1070
01:33:05,649 --> 01:33:06,733
Lucio!

1071
01:33:12,057 --> 01:33:13,142
Lucio!

1072
01:33:18,165 --> 01:33:19,249
Lucio!

1073
01:33:24,185 --> 01:33:25,269
Lucio!

1074
01:33:30,216 --> 01:33:31,301
Lucio!

1075
01:33:34,211 --> 01:33:35,296
Lucio!

1076
01:33:36,489 --> 01:33:37,489
Psst!

1077
01:33:38,199 --> 01:33:39,909
- Hey. - Lucio?

1078
01:33:40,717 --> 01:33:42,098
Hey, I'm here.

1079
01:33:42,995 --> 01:33:44,086
Lucio!

1080
01:33:45,498 --> 01:33:46,520
Lucio.

1081
01:33:48,642 --> 01:33:49,762
What happened?

1082
01:36:30,073 --> 01:36:31,950
First, Gigi left.

1083
01:36:33,286 --> 01:36:34,960
Then Lucio.

1084
01:36:35,975 --> 01:36:37,977
Now Brenda too.

1085
01:36:38,458 --> 01:36:41,169
It's fine if Lucio and Gigi leave.

1086
01:36:41,534 --> 01:36:44,810
Just not Brenda. She's kind.

1087
01:36:45,019 --> 01:36:46,145
Hey Melody,

1088
01:36:46,517 --> 01:36:48,744
don't speak badly of my Lucio.

1089
01:36:49,138 --> 01:36:52,230
Could Brenda have followed Lucio?

1090
01:36:54,363 --> 01:36:59,493
Maybe. But they know how to come back here.

1091
01:37:00,168 --> 01:37:04,200
Brenda's mind is clearer now. I'm sure she'll come back to us.

1092
01:37:05,764 --> 01:37:08,225
I'll always pray that Brenda returns.

1093
01:37:09,344 --> 01:37:11,246
